        <activityName xml:lang="en">Charger, for smartphone, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Charger, for smartphone, at plant
The data set represents the production of smartphone charger; UUID: 6fb8d38b-cdef-3d8f-ab47-f8b320a93948
The dataset is modelled as a smaller version of power adapter for laptops, which is already updated and described in the other separate dataset module. The weight of charger is approximately 50 grams.
Location: Data for global average charger for smartphone
Technology: Standard charger for smartphones, with power consumption of 5 - 10W.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6fb8d38b-cdef-3d8f-ab47-f8b320a93948.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
